<title>USA: Access Solutions names H. Yenke chairman.</title>
<headline>Access Solutions names H. Yenke chairman.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH KINGSTOWN, R.I. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Access Solutions International Inc said Thursday it named Howard Yenke chairman, replacing Malcolm Chace III.</p>
<p>Yenke is currently president and chief executive of LANart Corp. He is also on the boards of Checkmate Electronics Inc, Rexall Sundown Inc and Communication Systems International.</p>
<p>Access Solutions makes and sells information storage and retrieval systems, including software and hardware.</p>
